e sequence recognition requirements of the SH2 domains of SH-PTP2</article-title><source>Biochemistry</source><year>1995</year><volume>34</volume><fpage>1040</fpage><lpage>1049</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7530043</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1021/bi00003a039</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>CH</given-names></name><name><surname>Kominos</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Jacques</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Margolis</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Schlessinger</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Shoelson</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name><name><surname>Kuriyan</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Crystal structures of peptide complexes of the amino-terminal SH2 domain of the Syp tyrosine phosphatase</article-title><source>Structure</source><year>1994</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>423</fpage><lpage>438</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7521735</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0969-2126(00)00044-7</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Eck</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Pluskey</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Trub</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Harrison</surname><given-names>SC</given-names></name><name><surname>Shoelson</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Spatial constraints on the recognition of phosphoproteins by the tandem SH2 domains of the phosphatase SH-PTP2</article-title><source>Nature</source><year>1996</year><volume>379</volume><fpage>277</fpage><lpage>280</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8538796</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/379277a0</pub-id><